# Local Claude Code config: hooks, rules, skills, settings
.claude/

data/bird-mini-dev/*
!data/bird-mini-dev/dev_databases/
data/bird-mini-dev/dev_databases/*
!data/bird-mini-dev/dev_databases/superhero/
